Task: Investigate camera-only and built-in frustum culling; select the render-budget lever.

Summary:
- Audited the live scene inventory: 0 meshes disable frustum culling, and the renderer already submits fewer calls than the visible mesh inventory. Manual per-frame camera visibility was rejected as redundant and risky.
